_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forks of Fate: Twice in a run, you must choose between significant run-long tradeoffs. Do you go for maximum power, select the vulnerability your build can best endure or go for the best of both worlds?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/350fbd530c1a4c09c9826c23fa777de3.poster.avif?t=1768639313\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/350fbd530c1a4c09c9826c23fa777de3.webm?t=1768639313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/350fbd530c1a4c09c9826c23fa777de3.mp4?t=1768639313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lasting Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every attempt leaves something behind for you to build on. Titan essence collected during a run can be invested in the Sanctuary to unlock permanent upgrades, transforming every death into a step toward victory, ensuring that while your power increases, there are always fresh trials available to test your growing skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/2f42c3a8df0f9579306f585e4bfecc73.poster.avif?t=1768639313\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/2f42c3a8df0f9579306f585e4bfecc73.webm?t=1768639313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/2f42c3a8df0f9579306f585e4bfecc73.mp4?t=1768639313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploring a Broken World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through fragmented zones where each route presents a clear reward. Weigh risks and opportunities, create your own path. Along the way you encounter the world\u2019s surviving denizens from whom you can learn more about the world\u2019s state and the forces that shaped it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run helps you grow stronger, more capable and more prepared for the challenges that lie ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/91740bcd5441fd467610c4b788e61fe4.poster.avif?t=1768639313\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/91740bcd5441fd467610c4b788e61fe4.webm?t=1768639313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/extras/91740bcd5441fd467610c4b788e61fe4.mp4?t=1768639313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Shifting Reality Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383100/f563ee22c41af742088f296ddece95f30249fb2c/header.jpg?t=1768639313","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3383100/1049666800/631899062a2e980f313e83f029672eedff3efe17/1758208355/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758212224","dash_h264":